+**Outputs:** A label for each point in $P$: a cluster ID (integer $\ge 0$) or NOISE [G].
 
 **Data Structures:**
 - $P$: List of points.
 - $labels$: Array of size $|P|$, initialized to UNCLASSIFIED.
-- $S$: A list/queue of points to be expanded.
